Setup			3d_sbbh

### Disk parameters

AspectRatio     	0.02            Thickness over Radius in the disc
Sigma0			1.0e-4		Surface Density at r=1
Alpha			1.0e-2		Uniform kinematic viscosity  (was nu in p3disof)
SigmaSlope		1.0		Slope of surface
FlaringIndex		0.0


### Binary parameters 

Bbhomegaratio   3.1425837348205774
Bbhseparation   0.01856635533445112

DampingZone     1.15
TauDamp         0.3

ExcludeHill     yes

### Planet parameters

PlanetConfig		planets/sbbh.cfg
ThicknessSmoothing 	0.018563	Smoothing parameters in disk thickness (ts = 3*deltaR/H)


### Numerical method parameters

Disk			YES
OmegaFrame     		1.0
Frame			F
IndirectTerm		No

### Mesh parameters

Nx              2048              # Azimuthal
Ny              1024              # Radial
Nz              696               # Colatitude

Xmin            -3.14159265358979323844
Xmax             3.14159265358979323844

Ymin            0.4
Ymax            2.5

Zmin            1.42079632679489661922   
Zmax            1.72079632679489661922  

### Non-uniform spacing

Spacing         N                     # Non-uniform, from mesh-density function
XMa             0.025
XMb             0.055
XMc             34.77

YMa             0.025
YMb             0.055
YMc             36.51
YMy0            1.0                   # Refinement center in r

ZMA             0.025                  # new   
ZMB             0.055
ZMC             34.7
ZMZ0            1.5707963267948966    # center in  pi/2

### Output control parameters

Ntot			60		Total number of time steps
Ninterm	 		2		Time steps between outputs
DT			0.314159265359	Time step length. 2PI = 1 orbit
OutputDir		@outputs/3d_sbbh_test_wbin13


Field 			gasdens
PlotLine		field[-1,:,:]
